<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Boral sells Perry Engineering unit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Boral sells Perry Engineering unit.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Building products company Boral Ltd said on Tuesday it had sold its Adelaide-based heavy engineering operation, Perry Engineering, to the South Australian privately owned Pope Electric Motors Pty Ltd.</p>
<p>Boral said the firm had been a non-core business and the sale of Perry Engineering completed the company's exit from the industry.</p>
<p>No terms of the sale were disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
